B.Yf=new A.hX("sip-basics","investing","\ud83d\udcb9",3,"SIP kya hai \u2014 chai se sasta","SIP \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u2014 \u091a\u093e\u092f \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0938\u094d\u0924\u093e",B.a8U)
B.XO=new A.cr("p","Compounding means your returns start earning their own returns. Like a snowball rolling downhill \u2014 small at first, then suddenly huge. The magic ingredient is not money; it is TIME.","Compounding ka matlab hai \u2014 aapke munafe par bhi munafa lagna\u0964 Jaise barf ka gola dheere-dheere badhta chala jata hai\u0964 Asli jaadu paisa nahi, SAMAY hai\u0964")
B.XI=new A.cr("ex","\u20b910,000/month at 12%: in 10 years \u2248 \u20b923 lakh. In 20 years \u2248 \u20b999 lakh. In 30 years \u2248 \u20b93.5 crore! The last 10 years create more wealth than the first 20 combined.","\u20b910,000/\u092e\u093e\u0939 12% \u092a\u0930: 10 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u2248 \u20b923 \u0932\u093e\u0916\u0964 20 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u2248 \u20b999 \u0932\u093e\u0916\u0964 30 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u2248 \u20b93.5 \u0915\u0930\u094b\u0921\u093c! Aakhri 10 saal, pehle 20 saal se zyada daulat banate hain\u0964")
B.XZ=new A.cr("p","This is why a 25-year-old investing \u20b95,000/month can retire richer than a 40-year-old investing \u20b915,000/month \u2014 the early money gets more years to multiply.","Isi liye 25 saal ka vyakti jo \u20b95,000/\u092e\u093e\u0939 lagata hai, 40 saal ke \u20b915,000/\u092e\u093e\u0939 lagane wale se ameer retire ho sakta hai \u2014 jaldi laga paisa zyada saal tak badhta hai\u0964")
B.Yc=new A.cr("key",'Do not wait for a "big amount". The best day to start was 10 years ago; the second best is today.','"Badi rakam" ka intezaar mat kijiye\u0964 Shuru karne ka best din 10 saal pehle tha; dusra best din aaj hai\u0964')
B.a7G=s([B.XO,B.XI,B.XZ,B.Yc],t.Yd)
B.Yg=new A.hX("compounding","investing","\u2744\ufe0f",3,"Compounding \u2014 the snowball secret","Compounding \u2014 \u092c\u0930\u094d\u092b\u093c \u0915\u0947 \u0917\u094b\u0932\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u093e \u0930\u093e\u091c\u093c",B.a7G)
B.XN=new A.cr("p","If the earning member is not there tomorrow, who pays the school fees and EMIs? Term insurance answers this: a small yearly premium buys a very large cover (\u20b91 crore+) that your family receives if anything happens to you.","Agar kamane wala kal na raha, to school fees aur EMI kaun bharega? Term insurance isi ka jawab hai: chhota yearly premium, bahut bada cover (\u20b91 \u0915\u0930\u094b\u0921\u093c+) \u2014 agar aapko kuch ho jaye to parivaar ko milta hai\u0964")
B.Yb=new A.cr("p","Term plan = pure protection, no money-back. That is exactly why it is cheap \u2014 like paying a watchman to guard your house; you do not expect your salary back from him.","Term plan = sirf suraksha, paisa wapas nahi milta\u0964 Yehi wajah hai ki ye sasta hai \u2014 jaise ghar ki rakhwali ke liye chowkidar ki salary; usse paisa wapas nahi maangte\u0964")
B.XG=new A.cr("ex","A healthy 30-year-old can get \u20b91 crore cover for roughly \u20b9800\u20131,000/month \u2014 less than one family pizza outing. Waiting till 40 nearly doubles the price.","30 saal ka swasth vyakti \u20b91 \u0915\u0930\u094b\u0921\u093c \u0915\u093e cover \u0932\u0917\u092d\u0917 \u20b9800\u20131,000/\u092e\u093e\u0939 me le sakta hai \u2014 ek pizza-outing se bhi kam\u0964 40 tak rukne par daam lagbhag dugna\u0964")
B.XD=new A.cr("tip","Cover = 10\u201315\xd7 your annual income. The Family Plan in this app computes your exact shield (HLV) before suggesting any investment.","Cover = aapki saalana income ka 10\u201315 guna\u0964 Is app ka Family Plan investment se PEHLE aapki exact shield (HLV) nikal deta hai\u0964")
B.Y1=new A.cr("key","First insure the earning hands, then invest. Investment without insurance is a house without a foundation.","Pehle kamane wale haath ka insurance, phir investment\u0964 Bina insurance ka investment, bina neev ka ghar hai\u0964")
B.aac=s([B.XN,B.Yb,B.XG,B.XD,B.Y1],t.Yd)
B.Yh=new A.hX("term-insurance","protection","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f",3,"Term insurance \u2014 family ki shield","Term insurance \u2014 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0940 \u0922\u093e\u0932",B.aac)
B.XP=new A.cr("p","Before any investment, keep aside 3\u20136 months of your household expenses in a safe, instantly available place \u2014 savings account or liquid fund. This is your umbrella for job loss, illness or a sudden repair.","Koi bhi investment karne se pehle, ghar ke 3\u20136 mahine ke kharch barabar paisa safe aur turant milne wali jagah rakho \u2014 savings account ya liquid fund\u0964 Naukri jaana, bimari ya achanak kharch \u2014 ye aapki chhaata hai\u0964")
B.Y3=new A.cr("ex","Monthly expense \u20b940,000 \u2192 emergency fund target = \u20b91.2\u20132.4 lakh. Build it slowly: \u20b95,000/month fills it in 2\u20134 years, and then it just sits there protecting every other investment.","Mahine ka kharch \u20b940,000 \u2192 emergency fund ka target = \u20b91.2\u20132.4 \u0932\u093e\u0916\u0964 Dheere-dheere banao: \u20b95,000/\u092e\u093e\u0939 se 2\u20134 saal me poora \u2014 phir ye aapke baaki sab investments ki raksha karta rahega\u0964")
B.Y2=new A.cr("tip","Never invest this fund in shares or lock it in long FDs. Boring is beautiful here \u2014 the goal is instant availability, not returns.",'Is fund ko kabhi shares me mat lagao aur lambi FD me mat bandho\u0964 Yahan "boring" hi sundar hai \u2014 maqsad returns nahi, turant milna hai\u0964')
B.XJ=new A.cr("key","Emergency fund first, everything else after. One hospital bill should never force you to break your SIP.","Pehle emergency fund, baaki sab baad me\u0964 Ek hospital bill aapko SIP todne par majboor nahi karna chahiye\u0964")
B.a6L=s([B.XP,B.Y3,B.Y2,B.XJ],t.Yd)
B.Ye=new A.hX("emergency-fund","protection","\ud83c\udf02",2,"Emergency fund \u2014 pehla kadam","Emergency fund \u2014 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e \u0915\u093c\u0926\u092e",B.a6L)
B.Xx=new A.cr("p","EMI looks small and friendly, but the real cost of a loan is the INTEREST you pay over the years. In the first few years of a home loan, most of your EMI is interest \u2014 very little goes to reducing the loan.","EMI chhoti aur pyari lagti hai, par loan ka asli daam hai woh INTEREST jo aap saalon tak dete ho\u0964 Home loan ke shuru ke saalon me EMI ka zyada tar hissa interest hota hai \u2014 loan kam bahut thoda hota hai\u0964")
B.XB=new A.cr("ex","\u20b925 lakh home loan, 8.5%, 20 years \u2192 EMI \u2248 \u20b921,700/month \u2192 total paid \u2248 \u20b952 lakh. Interest alone = \u20b927 lakh \u2014 more than the loan itself!","\u20b925 \u0932\u093e\u0916 home loan, 8.5%, 20 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u2192 EMI \u2248 \u20b921,700/\u092e\u093e\u0939 \u2192 kul bhugtan \u2248 \u20b952 \u0932\u093e\u0916\u0964 Sirf interest = \u20b927 \u0932\u093e\u0916 \u2014 loan se bhi zyada!")
B.Y8=new A.cr("p","Two knobs change everything: tenure and rate. Cutting 20 years to 15 raises EMI a little (\u2248\u20b92,900) but saves \u2248 \u20b99.4 lakh interest. Even 0.5% lower rate saves lakhs on a big loan.","Do cheezein sab badal deti hain: avadhi (tenure) aur rate\u0964 20 se 15 saal karne par EMI thodi badhti hai (\u2248\u20b92,900) par \u2248 \u20b99.4 \u0932\u093e\u0916 interest bachta hai\u0964 Bade loan par 0.5% kam rate bhi lakhon bachata hai\u0964")
B.XC=new A.cr("tip","Rule of thumb: total EMIs \u2264 40% of take-home income. Use the app's EMI Calculator before signing anything \u2014 it shows the true total cost, live.","Angootha-niyam: saari EMIs milakar take-home ka 40% se kam\u0964 Sign karne se pehle app ka EMI Calculator zaroor chalao \u2014 woh asli kul laagat live dikhata hai\u0964")
B.XQ=new A.cr("key","Compare loans by TOTAL COST, not by monthly EMI. Small EMI + long tenure = silently expensive.","Loan ko monthly EMI se nahi, KUL LAAGAT se tulna karo\u0964 Chhoti EMI + lambi avadhi = chupke se mehnga\u0964")
B.aae=s([B.Xx,B.XB,B.Y8,B.XC,B.XQ],t.Yd)
B.Yj=new A.hX("emi-truth","loans","\ud83c\udfe0",3,"EMI ka poora sach","EMI \u0915\u093e \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0938\u091a",B.aae)
B.XF=new A.cr("p","Prepaying means paying extra towards your loan principal, over and above the EMI. In early years this attacks the loan when interest is at its peak \u2014 every extra rupee saves several rupees of future interest.","Prepayment ka matlab hai EMI ke alawa loan ke principal me extra paisa dalna\u0964 Shuruati saalon me ye tab attack karta hai jab interest peak par hota hai \u2014 har extra rupaya bhavishya ke kai rupaye interest bachata hai\u0964")
B.XS=new A.cr("ex","On the same \u20b925L/20yr loan, one single prepayment of \u20b91 lakh in year 3 can save roughly \u20b93\u20134 lakh interest and cut the tenure by ~1.5 years. Bonus laga? Loan par daal do.","Usi \u20b925L/20 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u0915\u0947 loan par 3re saal ek hi baar \u20b91 \u0932\u093e\u0916 prepay karne par lagbhag \u20b93\u20134 \u0932\u093e\u0916 interest bach sakta hai aur avadhi ~1.5 saal ghat sakti hai\u0964 Bonus aaya? Loan me laga do\u0964")
B.Y0=new A.cr("tip",'Choose "reduce tenure" (not "reduce EMI") while prepaying \u2014 that is where the big savings hide. Check your loan for prepayment charges; most floating home loans have none.','Prepay karte waqt "tenure kam karo" chuno (EMI kam karne wala nahi) \u2014 badi bachat wahin chhipi hai\u0964 Apne loan ke prepayment charges zaroor dekho; zyadatar floating home loans me koi charge nahi hota\u0964')
B.Y6=new A.cr("key","Prepay early and prepay often \u2014 even small amounts. Time is the interest's best friend; make it yours.","Jaldi prepay karo aur baar-baar \u2014 chhoti rakam bhi chalegi\u0964 Samay interest ka sabse bada dost hai; ise apna dost banao\u0964")
B.a5E=s([B.XF,B.XS,B.Y0,B.Y6],t.Yd)
B.Yi=new A.hX("prepay-smart","loans","\u26a1",2,"Prepayment = dugna fayda","Prepayment = \u0926\u0941\u0917\u0928\u093e \u092b\u093c\u093e\u092f\u0926\u093e",B.a5E)
B.Y7=new A.cr("p","Retirement planning answers one question: after the salary stops, kaun deta hai monthly income? The answer is your CORPUS \u2014 a big enough pile whose returns pay your expenses forever.","Retirement planning ek hi sawaal ka jawab deti hai: salary band hone ke baad monthly income kaun dega? Jawab hai aapka CORPUS \u2014 itna bada fund jiske returns se aapka kharch hamesha chale\u0964")
B.XL=new A.cr("ex","Quick rule: yearly expense \xd7 25. Expenses \u20b940,000/month (\u20b94.8L/year) \u2192 target corpus \u2248 \u20b91.2 crore in today's money. Sounds scary? Spread over 25\u201330 years of SIPs it is very reachable.","Aasaan niyam: saal ka kharch \xd7 25\u0964 Kharch \u20b940,000/\u092e\u093e\u0939 (\u20b94.8L/\u0938\u093e\u0932) \u2192 target corpus \u2248 \u20b91.2 \u0915\u0930\u094b\u0921\u093c aaj ke hisaab se\u0964 Dar lagta hai? 25\u201330 saal ki SIP me baanto to bilkul mumkin hai\u0964")
B.XV=new A.cr("p","This app's Family Plan splits retirement into 3 buckets \u2014 essential expenses guaranteed, comforts from safe growth, and a legacy bucket. You see the exact monthly SIP needed, after inflation.","Is app ka Family Plan retirement ko 3 buckets me baantta hai \u2014 zaroori kharch guaranteed, aaraam wali cheezein safe growth se, aur ek legacy bucket\u0964 Inflation ke baad exact monthly SIP aapke saamne hoti hai\u0964")
B.Xw=new A.cr("tip","Start retirement savings in your 20s\u201330s, even symbolically. A \u20b92,000 SIP at 25 grows to more than a \u20b910,000 SIP started at 45.","Retirement saving 20\u201330 \u0915\u0940 age me hi shuru karo, chahe naam ke paiso se hi\u0964 25 par shuru \u20b92,000 SIP, 45 par shuru \u20b910,000 SIP se zyada ban jata hai\u0964")
B.Y5=new A.cr("key","Retirement is not an age, it is a number \u2014 your corpus. The plan tells you the number and the path.","Retirement koi umar nahi, ek number hai \u2014 aapka corpus\u0964 Plan aapko number bhi batata hai aur raasta bhi\u0964")
B.a8j=s([B.Y7,B.XL,B.XV,B.Xw,B.Y5],t.Yd)
B.Yd=new A.hX("pension-basics","retirement","\ud83d\udc74",3,"Retirement ka seedha hisaab","Retirement \u0915\u093e \u0938\u0940\u0927\u093e \u0939\u093f\u0938\u093e\u092c",B.a8j)
B.Ya=new A.cr("p","\u20b9100 today will not buy what \u20b9100 buys in 2045. At 6% inflation, prices double roughly every 12 years. Your future goals \u2014 college, marriage, retirement \u2014 will cost far more than today's price tags.","Aaj ka \u20b9100, 2045 me utna nahi khareed payega\u0964 6% inflation par daam lagbhag har 12 saal me dugna\u0964 Aapke future ke goals \u2014 college, shaadi, retirement \u2014 aaj ke daam se kahin zyada mehngi padengi\u0964")
B.Xy=new A.cr("ex","Class-11 engineering admission costing \u20b910 lakh today will need roughly \u20b924+ lakh in 15 years at 6% inflation. Planning for \u20b910 lakh means falling short by 60%!","Aaj \u20b910 \u0932\u093e\u0916 me hone wali engineering padhai, 15 saal baad 6% inflation par lagbhag \u20b924+ \u0932\u093e\u0916 maangegi\u0964 \u20b910 \u0932\u093e\u0916 ki planning ka matlab 60% se kam pad jaana!")
B.XH=new A.cr("p",'This is why "safe" cash under the mattress is actually risky \u2014 it silently loses value every single year. Your money must grow at least as fast as inflation, ideally faster.','Isi liye gaddi ke neeche "safe" rakha cash asal me risky hai \u2014 woh har saal chupke se value kho deta hai\u0964 Aapka paisa kam se kam inflation jitna to badhe, behtar ho ki usse zyada\u0964')
B.XR=new A.cr("key","Always plan goals in tomorrow's prices, not today's. Every goal in this app is auto-adjusted for inflation \u2014 that is the honest number.","Goals ki planning hamesha kal ke daam par karo, aaj ke nahi\u0964 Is app ka har goal inflation ke liye auto-adjust hota hai \u2014 wahi imaandaar number hai\u0964")
B.a8b=s([B.Ya,B.Xy,B.XH,B.XR],t.Yd)
B.Yk=new A.hX("inflation","retirement","\ud83c\udf88",2,"Inflation \u2014 chupchaap chor","Inflation \u2014 \u091a\u0941\u092a\u091a\u093e\u092a \u091a\u094b\u0930",B.a8b)
B.XX=new A.cr("p","The simplest budget on earth: take your after-tax salary and cut the cake three ways \u2014 50% for NEEDS (rent, food, school), 30% for WANTS (outings, shopping, OTT), 20% for SAVINGS & investments.","Duniya ka sabse aasaan budget: tax ke baad wali salary ko teen hisso me kaato \u2014 50% ZARURAT ke liye (kiraya, khana, school), 30% SHOUK ke liye (ghoomna, shopping, OTT), 20% BACHAT aur investments ke liye\u0964")
B.Xz=new A.cr("ex","\u20b960,000 take-home \u2192 \u20b930,000 needs + \u20b918,000 wants + \u20b912,000 savings. If needs eat 70%, trim wants a little \u2014 never touch the 20% first.","\u20b960,000 take-home \u2192 \u20b930,000 zaroorat + \u20b918,000 shauk + \u20b912,000 bachat\u0964 Agar zaroorat 70% kha rahi hai, to shauk se thoda kaato \u2014 20% ko sabse aakhir me chhuo\u0964")
B.Y_=new A.cr("tip","Make the 20% leave the account on salary day itself \u2014 autodate your SIP for the 2nd of the month. Willpower is unreliable; automation wins.","20% ko salary ke din hi account se nikal do \u2014 SIP ki date mahine ki 2 tarikh rakho\u0964 Iraade par bharosa kam, automation par zyada \u2014 automation hi jeetata hai\u0964")
B.Y4=new A.cr("key","Pay yourself first. Spending what is left after saving beats saving what is left after spending.","Pehle khud ko payment karo\u0964 Bachat ke baad jo bache use kharch karna \u2014 kharch ke baad bachane se hamesha behtar hai\u0964")
B.a5n=s([B.XX,B.Xz,B.Y_,B.Y4],t.Yd)
B.Yl=new A.hX("rule-503020","habits","\ud83c\udf70",2,"50/30/20 \u2014 salary ka perfect cut","50/30/20 \u2014 \u0938\u0948\u0932\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u0930\u092b\u093c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0915\u091f",B.a5n)
B.Y9=new A.cr("p",'India offers two income-tax "menus". NEW regime: lower tax rates, but almost no deductions allowed. OLD regime: higher rates, but you can reduce taxable income using 80C (PF/PPF/ELSS), HRA, home-loan interest, insurance, etc.','India me income-tax ke do "menu" hain\u0964 NEW regime: rate kam, par deduction lagbhag kuch nahi\u0964 OLD regime: rate zyada, par aap 80C (PF/PPF/ELSS), HRA, home-loan interest, insurance aadi se taxable income ghata sakte ho\u0964')
B.Xv=new A.cr("p","Rule of thumb for FY 2025-26: if your deductions are small (under ~\u20b93\u20134 lakh), the NEW regime usually wins \u2014 and up to \u20b912 lakh taxable income (\u20b912.75L salaried) it can mean ZERO tax via rebate.","FY 2025-26 ka angootha-niyam: agar aapke deductions chhote hain (~\u20b93\u20134 \u0932\u093e\u0916 se kam), to NEW regime aksar jeet-ta hai \u2014 aur \u20b912 \u0932\u093e\u0916 tak taxable income (salaried ke liye \u20b912.75L) par rebate se tax ZERO ho sakta hai\u0964")
B.XK=new A.cr("ex","Amit earns \u20b912L, no HRA, only \u20b91L PF/80C \u2192 NEW regime: effectively \u20b90 tax. Old regime would charge ~\u20b960k+. But with big HRA + home-loan interest, old can still win \u2014 always compare both.","Amit ki kamai \u20b912L, HRA nahi, sirf \u20b91L PF/80C \u2192 NEW regime: tax effectively \u20b90\u0964 Old regime ~\u20b960k+ leta\u0964 Par bada HRA + home-loan interest ho to old bhi jeet sakta hai \u2014 dono ka hisaab zaroor dekho\u0964")
B.XW=new A.cr("tip",'Do not buy random "tax-saving" products just to save tax. Save tax as a side-effect of good investments (ELSS, PPF), never the other way round. The app\'s Tax calculator compares both regimes in seconds.','Sirf tax bachane ke liye random "tax-saving" products mat kharido\u0964 Ache investments (ELSS, PPF) ka side-effect ke roop me tax bachao \u2014 kabhi ulta nahi\u0964 App ka Tax calculator dono regimes ko seconds me tulna karta hai\u0964')
B.XE=new A.cr("key","Regime choice is a calculation, not a habit. Compare once every year \u2014 salary changes, rules change.","Regime ka chunav habit nahi, hisaab hai\u0964 Har saal ek baar tulna karo \u2014 salary badalti hai, rules badalte hain\u0964")
B.a9Z=s([B.Y9,B.Xv,B.XK,B.XW,B.XE],t.Yd)
B.Ym=new A.hX("tax-basics","habits","\ud83e\uddfe",3,"New vs Old tax regime \u2014 simple","New vs Old tax regime \u2014 \u0906\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u092d\u093e\u0937\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902",B.a9Z)
